From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: acqxi <kacqxi@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 01:36:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 07/15] Stats for nerds: settings, placement and thread details

- Settings: Stats for nerds moves from Chat to Appearance, with its
  master switch, a "Where stats show" checkbox menu (under each reply,
  under the composer, in thread details; each backed by its own setting,
  the last by the thread details item) and one "Metrics" checkbox menu
  for every metric by full name and short label
  (statsForNerdsHiddenMetrics), with reset buttons, one-line descriptions
  and search entries (a metric's name finds the Metrics row).
- Thread details: a "Turn performance" item (id "performance", off by
  default, offered while Stats for nerds is on) with the current or last
  turn's metrics in the same compact grid as the composer popover.
- New catalog keys in every web locale.
